# Cloudflare Pages redirects
#
# Pretty per-audit URLs. Clients can be sent bigsplash.video/audit/big-valley/
# and the dynamic renderer at /audit/?id=big-valley loads the matching audit
# from the Apps Script endpoint.
#
# Static files take precedence — /audit/bigvalley/index.html still serves the
# hand-built fallback page if the folder exists.

/audit/:slug/  /audit/?id=:slug  200
/audit/:slug   /audit/?id=:slug  200
